The benchmark is synthetic: every person, organisation, address, fiscal code,
IBAN and other identifier in `data/benchmark.jsonl` was generated by
`leakrate/data/generator.py` from seeded lists and validated patterns, and does
not refer to any real individual. Model outputs in `results/` were produced by
the models named in the file names from that synthetic input.
